OL,3,GNEWSAKettering Town agrees sale to new
OL,4,Aowners
OL,5,
OL,6,FKettering Town Football Club says a
OL,7,Fdeal has been agreed for new owners to
OL,8,Ftake over.
OL,10,FIn a statement released on Tuesday, the
OL,11,Fclub said former players Brad
OL,12,FPiercewright and Craig Norman would be
OL,13,Fbuying the club from George Akhtar, who
OL,14,Fhas been in charge of the Poppies for
OL,15,Fmore than two years.
OL,17,FAkhtar said the next stage of the
OL,18,Fclub's development needed investment
OL,19,F"on a completely different scale" and
OL,20,Fthe new owners outlined an "ambitious
OL,21,Fvision".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
