OL,3,GNEWSAKettering Town agrees sale to new
OL,4,Aowners
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said: "I would not have agreed to
OL,7,Fpass ownership of the club on unless I
OL,8,Fbelieved the incoming owners had the
OL,9,Fambition, resources, and commitment to
OL,10,Fbuild upon what has already been
OL,11,Fachieved and take Kettering Town
OL,12,Fsignificantly further."
